{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43244","headline":"日暖万年枝 · 郑师贞","name":"日暖万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁树敷荣早，偏将丽日宜。\n光摇连北阙，影泛满南枝。\n得地方知照，逢时异赫曦。\n叶和盈数积，根是永年移。\n宵露犹残润，薰风更共吹。\n余晖诚可托，况近凤凰池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑师贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}